\f0\b INSTALL
\f1\b0 \
\
Install the program on your calculator using the Ti Connect software. The file you will want to move from the .zip you download is GDIST.8xp.\
\
The program will show up in your PRGM menu as GDIST.\
\

\f0\b INSTRUCTIONS
\f1\b0 \
\
The program calculates deceleration rate, time and g-force of a full stop from a given velocity and distance. All units in SI and are clear in the app.\
\